# LightGBM writes the booster as a text file, but it is an artifact, not source.
# On a machine with core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) a clone rewrites
# every LF in it as CRLF, and the booster then fails to load:
#
#     [LightGBM] [Fatal] Model format error, expect a tree here.
#
# The forecast cannot be built from a fresh clone when that happens. Check it
# out byte for byte instead.
api/artifacts/model.txt -text

# Never eol-convert these either.
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
